{"indicator_id":"library_count","domain":"education_culture","name":"公共図書館数","description":"自治体が設置する公共図書館の館数。設置者区分と集計対象を確認する。","unit":"館","measurement_type":"count","formula":null,"geographic_level":["prefecture","municipality"],"periodicity":"社会教育調査（概ね3年ごと）","comparison_direction":"context_dependent","source_ids":["src-mext-social-education"],"caveats":["都道府県立・市町村立・組合立等の設置者区分を保持する。","図書館数だけではアクセスの良さやサービス品質を示さない。"],"status":"candidate"}
{"indicator_id":"library_holdings_per_1000","domain":"education_culture","name":"人口千人あたり図書館蔵書数","description":"公共図書館の蔵書数を同一基準日の人口で除して比較する。","unit":"冊/人口千人","measurement_type":"rate","formula":"library_holdings / population * 1000","geographic_level":["prefecture","municipality"],"periodicity":"社会教育調査（概ね3年ごと）","comparison_direction":"context_dependent","source_ids":["src-mext-social-education","src-soumu-resident-register"],"caveats":["図書館統計と人口の基準日・対象範囲を合わせる。","雑誌や未整理資料など蔵書数の定義に注意する。"],"status":"candidate"}
{"indicator_id":"library_loans_per_capita","domain":"education_culture","name":"人口一人あたり貸出冊数","description":"年間貸出冊数を対象人口で除した値。","unit":"冊/人・年","measurement_type":"rate","formula":"annual_loans / population","geographic_level":["prefecture","municipality"],"periodicity":"社会教育調査（概ね3年ごと）","comparison_direction":"context_dependent","source_ids":["src-mext-social-education","src-soumu-resident-register"],"caveats":["調査年度と人口基準日を明記する。電子書籍の扱い・貸出対象範囲を確認する。"],"status":"candidate"}
{"indicator_id":"minyo_groups","domain":"culture","name":"民謡・民俗芸能の保存団体数","description":"地域に所在し、民謡・民俗芸能の保存・伝承を行う団体を確認して記録する。","unit":"団体","measurement_type":"count","formula":null,"geographic_level":["prefecture","municipality","administrative_ward"],"periodicity":"随時調査・年次更新","comparison_direction":"not_scored","source_ids":["src-bunka-heritage-db","src-municipality-official-sites"],"caveats":["全国一律の完全な団体名簿ではない。未発見を団体不存在とみなさない。","団体の現存・活動状況・所在地・対象芸能を個別確認する。"],"status":"candidate"}
{"indicator_id":"minyo_support_dimensions","domain":"culture","name":"民謡バックアップ施策の確認項目","description":"保存会支援、後継者育成、学校・地域学習、記録保存、発表機会、補助・助成、担い手交流の7項目について根拠を記録する。","unit":"確認項目（7項目）","measurement_type":"checklist","formula":null,"geographic_level":["prefecture","municipality","administrative_ward"],"periodicity":"年次調査","comparison_direction":"not_scored","source_ids":["src-municipality-official-sites","src-bunka-heritage-db"],"caveats":["公開情報で確認できないことは未実施と同義ではない。未調査・確認できず・実施確認を区別する。","項目数をそのまま自治体の文化政策の優劣とみなさず、予算・継続年数・参加者等の根拠も蓄積する。"],"status":"candidate"}
{"indicator_id":"foreign_resident_share","domain":"population_diversity","name":"外国籍住民比率","description":"住民基本台帳上の外国人住民数を総人口で除した割合。","unit":"%","measurement_type":"ratio","formula":"foreign_resident_population / total_resident_population * 100","geographic_level":["prefecture","municipality","special_ward"],"periodicity":"年次（1月1日現在）","comparison_direction":"neutral","source_ids":["src-soumu-resident-register"],"caveats":["分子・分母は同じ基準日・住民基本台帳ベースに統一する。","比率は多文化共生施策の充実度や個人の属性を評価する点数ではない。"],"status":"candidate"}
{"indicator_id":"foreign_resident_count","domain":"population_diversity","name":"外国籍住民数","description":"住民基本台帳上の外国人住民人口。比率の分子および規模把握に使う。","unit":"人","measurement_type":"count","formula":null,"geographic_level":["prefecture","municipality","special_ward"],"periodicity":"年次（1月1日現在）","comparison_direction":"neutral","source_ids":["src-soumu-resident-register"],"caveats":["在留外国人数など異なる統計概念と混在させない。"],"status":"candidate"}
{"indicator_id":"birth_count","domain":"population_dynamics","name":"出生数","description":"対象地域で集計された年間出生数。","unit":"人/年","measurement_type":"count","formula":null,"geographic_level":["prefecture","municipality"],"periodicity":"年次","comparison_direction":"neutral","source_ids":["src-mhlw-vital-statistics"],"caveats":["出生地集計と住所地集計の違いを確認し、住所地ベースを優先する。"],"status":"candidate"}
{"indicator_id":"crude_birth_rate","domain":"population_dynamics","name":"人口千人あたり出生率（普通出生率）","description":"年間出生数を人口で除した粗出生率。合計特殊出生率とは別指標。","unit":"出生/人口千人","measurement_type":"rate","formula":"annual_live_births / midyear_population * 1000","geographic_level":["prefecture","municipality"],"periodicity":"年次","comparison_direction":"neutral","source_ids":["src-mhlw-vital-statistics","src-stat-population-estimates"],"caveats":["人口分母の基準（年央人口等）を明示する。年齢構成の影響を受ける。","出生数の集計地域と人口の地域範囲を一致させる。"],"status":"candidate"}
{"indicator_id":"total_fertility_rate","domain":"population_dynamics","name":"合計特殊出生率","description":"年齢別出生率を合計した指標。普通出生率・出生数とは区別する。","unit":"人/女性","measurement_type":"rate","formula":"sum(age_specific_fertility_rates)","geographic_level":["prefecture","municipality"],"periodicity":"市区町村別は国勢調査年を中心とした5年間集計（公表回ごと）","comparison_direction":"neutral","source_ids":["src-mhlw-vital-statistics","src-mhlw-municipal-vital-statistics"],"caveats":["市区町村別の合計特殊出生率は、国勢調査年を中心とした5年間のデータをまとめ、ベイズ推定で安定化した公表値を利用する。対象期間・地域境界・推定方法を併記する。","年次の都道府県値と市区町村別の5年集計値を同じ時系列として直結しない。","政策の因果効果や自治体の優劣を直接示すものではない。"],"status":"candidate"}
